        "explanation": "Rodzaje testów."
      },
      {
        "id": "b2-vocab-it-software-testing-3-02",
        "type": "cloze",
        "prompt": "The bug was ___ yesterday, but it came back, so I reopened it. (zamknięty)",
        "answer": "closed",
        "explanation": "Close / reopen a bug."
      },
      {
        "id": "b2-vocab-it-software-testing-3-03",
        "type": "cloze",
        "prompt": "He wrote a test ___ for every requirement. (przypadek)",
